WEBVTT

00:08.808 --> 00:16.850
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.850 --> 00:24.848
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.365 --> 00:36.169
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.169 --> 00:39.172
Believing, dreaming

00:39.172 --> 00:43.009
We are searching

00:43.009 --> 00:48.140
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:49.949 --> 00:58.358
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.358 --> 01:02.929
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.929 --> 01:05.598
Ah, surely someday

01:05.598 --> 01:13.873
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.873 --> 01:18.833
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.380 --> 01:27.013
Let's begin our journey

01:46.139 --> 01:49.336
Worry not, Lord Odin.

01:52.145 --> 01:57.378
We Norns, the goddesses of fate,
shall eliminate Lord Loki.

01:58.418 --> 02:02.013
And without fail, we shall do so
before the Ragnarok.

02:07.393 --> 02:13.093
The 15th Night
The Beautiful Assassins

02:17.137 --> 02:18.934
Would you two stop that?!

02:24.844 --> 02:26.539
Here I come, Daddy.

02:54.207 --> 02:55.834
Whenever you're ready, Fenrir.

03:05.451 --> 03:08.087
Even if you haven't gathered
much evil energy,

03:08.087 --> 03:10.681
you should still be able to use
power the way you used to.

03:11.324 --> 03:12.916
If I can remember how, that is...

03:13.626 --> 03:15.992
Then I'll make you remember!

03:22.068 --> 03:23.035
Master Loki!

03:41.354 --> 03:43.322
Vere luvadrok!

03:53.066 --> 03:55.602
That's it. Now I remember!

03:55.602 --> 03:56.534
Brother!

04:00.773 --> 04:02.609
You did it, Daddy!

04:02.609 --> 04:04.907
Thanks, Fenrir.

04:05.245 --> 04:07.213
Way to go, big brother!

04:07.213 --> 04:10.116
You put yourself on the line to help
Master Loki regain his powers!

04:10.116 --> 04:11.718
I am truly impressed!

04:11.718 --> 04:15.622
It's no biggie. Anyway, Daddy,
would you let me out now?

04:15.622 --> 04:17.490
Oh, okay.

04:17.490 --> 04:20.560
How do you let people out again?

04:20.560 --> 04:21.857
Ah, that's right!

04:22.395 --> 04:23.555
Cuerios!

04:26.232 --> 04:27.400
No way!

04:27.400 --> 04:30.270
Oh. Wrong one. That was to destroy it.

04:30.270 --> 04:32.605
Uh, Daddy! The mirror's going to break!

04:32.605 --> 04:34.274
Do something quick, Master Loki!

04:34.274 --> 04:37.038
Don't rush me! I'll remember in a bit.

04:38.411 --> 04:40.113
Daddy! Daddy! Daddy! Daddy!

04:40.113 --> 04:41.580
Master Loki!

04:41.848 --> 04:43.042
Let's see...

04:45.852 --> 04:47.376
Brother!

04:48.621 --> 04:50.145
I'm done for!

04:51.958 --> 04:52.925
Hoebus!

04:55.795 --> 04:57.092
Fenrir!

04:58.564 --> 05:01.234
My tail got chopped in half!

05:01.234 --> 05:02.702
Sorry about that!

05:02.702 --> 05:05.571
As long as you're all right,
that's what matters most!

05:05.571 --> 05:07.732
Yeah, it's great to be alive.

05:07.940 --> 05:09.464
There you are!

05:09.876 --> 05:11.070
Loki!

05:12.445 --> 05:13.469
Midnight-Sun Fortune-telling
We will predict your future with
stunning accuracy using
secret Norse techniques!
Midnight-Sun Fortune-telling
will change your life!!

05:14.213 --> 05:15.682
Midnight Sun Fortune-telling?

05:15.682 --> 05:18.310
Yeah! I heard they're totally accurate too!

05:18.551 --> 05:19.984
Midnight-Sun Fortune-telling
We will predict your future with
stunning accuracy using
secret Norse techniques!
Midnight-Sun Fortune-telling
will change your life!!

05:20.753 --> 05:23.756
"We will predict your future with stunning
accuracy using secret Norse techniques."

05:23.756 --> 05:26.926
"Midnight Sun Fortune-telling
will change your life."

05:26.926 --> 05:28.723
Is that right?

05:29.495 --> 05:31.331
And where are they doing this?

05:31.331 --> 05:34.534
In the vacant lot over that way,
in a pitch-black tent.

05:34.534 --> 05:37.469
This sure smells like a mystery to me!

05:39.205 --> 05:40.139
Pitch-black tent! Mystery! Fortune-telling!

05:40.139 --> 05:43.142
There she goes again with her
chronic mystery syndrome.
Pitch-black tent! Mystery! Fortune-telling!

05:43.142 --> 05:46.600
Ooh, ooh, ooh! Let's all go together!
I'm sure it'll be a blast!

05:49.148 --> 05:50.616
I'll pass.

05:50.616 --> 05:52.185
Huh? Why?!

05:52.185 --> 05:53.586
Fortune-telling doesn't interest me.

05:53.586 --> 05:55.188
No way...

05:55.188 --> 05:57.623
Okay, fine. Yamino and I will...

05:57.623 --> 06:00.751
Uh, sorry, but I'm not exactly a
fan of such things, either.

06:01.427 --> 06:06.330
Besides, I'm expecting a mail-order shipment
to arrive today, so I need to stay here.

06:06.566 --> 06:09.168
What?! You mean you can't come either?

06:09.168 --> 06:10.536
What a shock...

06:10.536 --> 06:11.871
Oh, well.

06:11.871 --> 06:14.101
C'mon, Fenrir, why don't we go together?

06:15.942 --> 06:17.842
What are you playing dead for?!

06:20.012 --> 06:23.345
Fine! I'll just go on my own.

06:23.850 --> 06:26.452
And I'll have tons of fun too!

06:26.452 --> 06:27.817
So there!

06:28.888 --> 06:31.584
I wonder if that was wrong of us?

06:31.958 --> 06:36.918
If we go along with Mayura every single time,
we'll end up with mystery syndrome ourselves.

06:37.463 --> 06:39.931
Would you please prepare some tea, Yamino?

06:40.400 --> 06:42.368
Yes, right away!

06:42.568 --> 06:44.536
It's all right now, big brother.

06:49.542 --> 06:50.907
My word!

07:16.469 --> 07:18.638
Wow, what a line!

07:18.638 --> 07:20.071
Oh! Daidoji!

07:20.373 --> 07:21.541
Narugami!

07:21.541 --> 07:23.839
Come here a second! Quick!

07:25.144 --> 07:27.112
So you came too, huh?

07:27.947 --> 07:29.812
Let me ask you a favor real quick.

07:30.983 --> 07:33.286
Actually, I'm still in the middle of a shift.

07:33.286 --> 07:36.155
I need to go back and have a
quick word with my co-workers.

07:36.155 --> 07:38.825
Can you hold my place for a bit?

07:38.825 --> 07:40.122
Hold your place?

07:41.093 --> 07:42.595
I'm counting on you!

07:42.595 --> 07:45.291
Hey, hold on! Narugami!

07:45.665 --> 07:47.132
Jeez...

07:47.366 --> 07:48.333
Huh?

07:50.136 --> 07:52.305
What a load of crap!

07:52.305 --> 07:57.643
"Oh, ill-tempered person, a watery
disaster will befall you."

07:57.643 --> 07:59.645
Now, now, take it easy.

07:59.645 --> 08:01.180
Sure, you can say that.

08:01.180 --> 08:02.849
Your fortune was,

08:02.849 --> 08:06.652
"You, who are always earnest, shall
receive a glittering present"!

08:06.652 --> 08:10.588
Still, you can never tell if a fortune
is on the level or not.

08:10.923 --> 08:12.584
Mr. Thief!

08:13.359 --> 08:16.328
Ah! It's my Japanese beauty!

08:19.198 --> 08:21.267
She's so beautiful!

08:21.267 --> 08:25.037
More beautiful than all that can be found
in the mountains or the sea!

08:25.037 --> 08:26.372
Huh?

08:26.372 --> 08:27.940
She was right!

08:27.940 --> 08:32.775
I have indeed received a glittering
present, just as predicted!

08:33.346 --> 08:35.143
That's ridiculous.

08:35.781 --> 08:37.248
See you back at the house.

08:42.288 --> 08:44.624
That is truly a watery disaster!

08:44.624 --> 08:47.593
Heimdall, your fortune was right on the mark!

08:51.197 --> 08:52.664
What do you think you're doing?!

08:55.201 --> 08:58.034
So it really does work.

09:05.645 --> 09:07.947
I wish I could've gone too!

09:07.947 --> 09:10.415
What would you have wanted them to predict?

09:11.684 --> 09:13.117
I...

09:13.753 --> 09:15.118
I...

09:18.724 --> 09:21.192
Master Loki, my order arrived!

09:21.761 --> 09:22.819
What's that?

09:23.162 --> 09:24.564
Please observe.

09:24.564 --> 09:25.963
Switch on!

09:28.668 --> 09:30.036
A ladder, huh?

09:30.036 --> 09:34.407
Yes! It's the one-touch ladder you
can use anytime, anywhere.

09:34.407 --> 09:37.743
It's ultra lightweight, but
also extremely durable!

09:37.743 --> 09:39.111
What do you think?

09:39.111 --> 09:43.844
It sounds nice, but would you even need
an "anytime, anywhere" ladder?

09:44.417 --> 09:46.351
Well, now that you mention it...

09:47.653 --> 09:50.850
Just seeing those ads on TV is enough
to make you want one, huh?

09:51.090 --> 09:52.925
This was a waste of money, wasn't it?

09:52.925 --> 09:54.392
What a letdown...

09:56.195 --> 09:57.856
Daddy! This is serious!

09:58.898 --> 09:59.865
Evil power?!

10:01.167 --> 10:03.135
Now, awaken!

10:11.844 --> 10:12.712
That thing is...

10:12.712 --> 10:13.804
A demon from the world of the gods!

10:15.014 --> 10:15.848
Master Loki!

10:15.848 --> 10:16.473
Daddy!

10:23.422 --> 10:24.821
Hi, Loki.

10:26.626 --> 10:28.321
Hey there, Freya.

10:28.661 --> 10:30.288
Thanks for the help.

10:30.963 --> 10:34.066
You mean that little girl
Reiya is really Freya?

10:34.066 --> 10:36.261
Um, actually yes.

10:37.703 --> 10:39.671
I should've been payin' more attention.

10:40.206 --> 10:42.041
Who would have a demon as a familiar?

10:42.041 --> 10:43.167
Skuld?

10:50.383 --> 10:52.783
What's taking Narugami so long?

10:55.354 --> 10:57.322
Next, please.

10:57.623 --> 11:00.751
Huh? But, I was just...

11:01.160 --> 11:03.822
Oh, well. It's his fault for
not coming back!

11:04.463 --> 11:07.023
Right! That would be me, if you don't mind!

11:12.938 --> 11:14.106
Please step inside.

11:14.106 --> 11:16.666
Wow, it's like a mystery already!

11:24.283 --> 11:25.807
We won't be needing you any longer.

11:38.798 --> 11:40.629
Excuse me!

11:51.077 --> 11:52.374
Welcome...

11:53.279 --> 11:56.908
to the profound world of the Midnight Sun.

12:11.630 --> 12:12.798
Let's go, Daddy!

12:12.798 --> 12:14.867
If that leaflet was really a creature, then...

12:14.867 --> 12:17.028
Yes. Mayura could be in trouble!

12:17.536 --> 12:18.833
Okay. Let's go!

12:19.405 --> 12:20.531
It's a trap.

12:22.108 --> 12:23.473
I know that.

12:24.376 --> 12:26.503
As thoughtful as always, aren't you?

12:27.513 --> 12:29.811
I won't let you go.

12:32.451 --> 12:37.423
I don't want my love going somewhere
I know is dangerous.

12:37.423 --> 12:38.657
Freya...

12:38.657 --> 12:39.851
Loki...

12:44.697 --> 12:46.096
Sorry, Freya!

12:48.768 --> 12:51.637
Make this turn up ahead. It's a shortcut!

12:51.637 --> 12:52.399
Okay!

12:52.972 --> 12:55.907
Let me out of here, Loki!
Can anyone hear me?!

12:56.408 --> 12:58.376
Big brother!

12:58.444 --> 12:58.933
Taiyaki
Azuma's Kitchen

13:00.679 --> 13:01.881
A cold?

13:01.881 --> 13:03.949
Yeah, probably.

13:03.949 --> 13:05.718
You know, that really did look like her.

13:05.718 --> 13:06.752
Who do you mean?

13:06.752 --> 13:08.554
That fortune-teller from earlier.

13:08.554 --> 13:11.423
She looked exactly like Urd, one of the Norns.

13:11.423 --> 13:12.892
You think so?

13:12.892 --> 13:15.961
I never saw much of the Norns,
so I don't remember what they look like.

13:15.961 --> 13:20.499
Well, they say that everyone in the
world's got their doppelganger.

13:20.499 --> 13:23.469
I'm sure it was just someone
who looked a lot like her.

13:23.469 --> 13:26.205
Here ya go. One sweet bean
and one custard.

13:26.205 --> 13:28.469
Excellent, excellent!

13:28.741 --> 13:30.402
Now we're all made up.

13:31.310 --> 13:33.245
I get the custard one.

13:33.245 --> 13:35.047
We'll rock-paper-scissors for it.

13:35.047 --> 13:36.412
I don't think so.

13:38.751 --> 13:41.353
Sheesh, I ended up not being able to leave.

13:41.353 --> 13:44.481
Ah, well. I'll just go ask
Daidoji how it was.

13:48.227 --> 13:51.685
Hmm... I can't decide what to ask!

13:52.298 --> 13:56.435
I want to know if the blood-sucking
Chupacabra really exists, but...

13:56.435 --> 14:00.973
I also want to know if there really are
aliens hidden in Hangar 18,

14:00.973 --> 14:04.773
or if any water imps have their nests nearby.

14:06.145 --> 14:11.105
Since this is a fortune-telling, I would think
it best to ask something about yourself.

14:12.351 --> 14:14.587
About myself?

14:14.587 --> 14:16.021
Oh, you mean like the future and stuff?

14:16.021 --> 14:18.224
Yeah, I'd certainly like to
know about that too.

14:18.224 --> 14:22.027
For that matter, I'd like to know if
my dad will get remarried.

14:22.027 --> 14:23.824
Oh.

14:24.697 --> 14:27.165
I'm sorry, please decide for me!

14:27.833 --> 14:33.635
In that case, why don't I tell about
your future love life?

14:33.873 --> 14:36.569
Sure! How exciting!

14:36.876 --> 14:40.141
Oh, and it doesn't matter
if he's human or not!

14:40.546 --> 14:43.913
Please gaze into the crystal ball.

14:44.350 --> 14:46.818
Look into this thing?

14:47.086 --> 14:48.144
All right!

14:57.696 --> 14:59.365
There's nobody here.

14:59.365 --> 15:00.696
Where's Mayura?

15:05.504 --> 15:06.869
Mayura is inside!

15:11.744 --> 15:12.733
It's alive!

15:13.279 --> 15:16.248
Dark alchemy! Is this Verdandi's doing?

15:23.322 --> 15:24.757
It's those things from before!

15:24.757 --> 15:26.486
There's a whole swarm of them!

15:27.760 --> 15:28.727
Mayura!

15:29.895 --> 15:31.730
What do you see?

15:31.730 --> 15:34.756
I don't really see much of anything.

15:35.401 --> 15:39.394
Please look carefully, Mayura Daidoji.

15:55.321 --> 15:57.690
Leave these things to us, Daddy!

15:57.690 --> 15:59.625
Go help Mayura! Quick!

15:59.625 --> 16:00.523
All right.

16:01.026 --> 16:03.051
Get out of my daddy's way!

16:03.562 --> 16:04.688
Now!

16:08.334 --> 16:10.302
Master Loki!
It's the perfect time for this!

16:11.737 --> 16:13.439
Ah!

16:13.439 --> 16:15.407
That was some smart shopping, Yamino!

16:15.407 --> 16:16.374
Wasn't it, though?

16:21.981 --> 16:24.149
Come on! Come get us!

16:24.149 --> 16:26.174
We'll be your opponents!

16:39.131 --> 16:41.099
A Bedazzling Space!

16:41.934 --> 16:43.902
This is your handiwork, isn't it, Urd?

17:37.256 --> 17:38.223
Mayura...

17:49.635 --> 17:50.932
Did that startle you?

17:55.774 --> 17:56.968
Mayura!

18:14.159 --> 18:15.524
You...

18:18.831 --> 18:20.492
Who are you?

18:30.943 --> 18:33.537
You look well, Loki.

18:34.780 --> 18:36.077
Odin...

18:37.116 --> 18:39.084
Have you become used to that form yet?

18:39.384 --> 18:42.785
Urd? I'm not interested in speaking
with some make-believe Odin.

18:43.355 --> 18:45.824
It really is me, Loki.

18:45.824 --> 18:48.793
I am borrowing this girl's body
to speak with you.

18:50.662 --> 18:52.653
Does that form pain you?

19:00.572 --> 19:02.938
I trust you've longed to be in this one again.

19:08.347 --> 19:09.837
Why?

19:10.816 --> 19:14.411
Why did you put me into the body of a child?

19:14.620 --> 19:16.918
What have I ever done to you?

19:18.090 --> 19:22.891
I don't recall doing anything to deserve
being banished from the world of the gods!

19:24.263 --> 19:25.958
You don't get it, do you?

19:27.332 --> 19:28.799
I see.

19:29.401 --> 19:34.100
Even though you've become a child,
you still don't understand.

19:35.174 --> 19:36.775
Loki...

19:36.775 --> 19:40.734
As the supreme god, I deliver unto
you this new sentence:

19:41.847 --> 19:44.213
I shall destroy you.

19:44.983 --> 19:48.942
I shall purge your existence
from the flow of time.

19:50.923 --> 19:52.390
Odin...

19:54.726 --> 19:58.594
There is no longer a place for you
in the world of the gods.

20:00.999 --> 20:04.093
Odin! This conversation isn't over yet!

20:08.607 --> 20:10.370
Odin! Wait!

20:10.509 --> 20:12.841
Odin!

20:17.182 --> 20:18.183
Daddy!
Mayura!

20:18.183 --> 20:19.418
Master Loki!

20:19.418 --> 20:20.419
Mayura...

20:20.419 --> 20:23.047
She's all right. She's just unconscious.

20:28.493 --> 20:31.724
You're the three Norn sisters.

20:32.297 --> 20:35.858
Urd, Verdandi and Skuld.

20:36.435 --> 20:39.632
Did you enjoy that, Master Loki?

20:41.306 --> 20:43.433
Today, we thought we'd just say hello.

20:44.009 --> 20:46.011
But next time, there will be no mercy.

20:46.011 --> 20:48.309
We will take your life.

20:49.348 --> 20:51.976
You are the goddesses who govern fate.

20:52.317 --> 20:55.286
Why would three such as yourselves
act as assassins?

20:56.088 --> 20:58.886
Because Ragnarok draws near.

21:00.993 --> 21:02.688
So that's why you're after me?

21:03.695 --> 21:06.994
You mean, I'll have something to do
with the end of the world?

21:07.799 --> 21:09.767
Stop talking nonsense!

21:10.235 --> 21:13.238
If you three are trying to
take Master Loki's life,

21:13.238 --> 21:16.696
then we will give ours to protect him!

21:16.942 --> 21:20.212
Do you want to know why you've been
exiled from the world of the gods

21:20.212 --> 21:22.481
and transformed into a child?

21:22.481 --> 21:26.685
Then see if you can think of the
sin that you've committed.

21:26.685 --> 21:29.449
That is the answer to all your questions.

21:30.022 --> 21:31.023
Sin?!

21:31.023 --> 21:33.491
Daddy hasn't committed any sins!

21:33.792 --> 21:34.690
That's right!

21:35.527 --> 21:37.262
You should know by now.

21:37.262 --> 21:39.498
In your current state,
you must surely realize.

21:39.498 --> 21:41.125
Enough of this crap!

21:42.868 --> 21:44.369
He went right through them!

21:44.369 --> 21:45.871
An illusion.

21:45.871 --> 21:47.338
See you again.

21:50.375 --> 21:52.502
Huh? Where am I?

21:54.046 --> 21:55.070
Loki!

21:56.214 --> 21:58.512
My sin?

22:16.835 --> 22:28.804
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.515 --> 22:42.260
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.260 --> 22:49.368
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.368 --> 22:55.807
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:55.807 --> 23:05.317
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.317 --> 23:09.654
Even if we're hurt

23:09.654 --> 23:21.666
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.666 --> 23:23.395
Believe in Heaven

23:31.176 --> 23:32.377
Next Episode

23:32.377 --> 23:35.580
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are
"marriage," "jingling bells" and "crested kimono."

23:35.580 --> 23:36.815
Next Episode
Marriage, huh?

23:36.815 --> 23:39.151
Next Episode
Say, Kotaro, what kind of wedding
would you like to have?

23:39.151 --> 23:39.985
Next Episode
Good question...

23:39.985 --> 23:40.986
Next Episode
Where are you going to have it?

23:40.986 --> 23:42.587
Next Episode
Hmm... Minaminoshima.

23:42.587 --> 23:43.722
Next Episode
How about the continent of Mu?!

23:43.722 --> 23:44.723
Next Episode
It sunk!

23:44.723 --> 23:46.825
Next Episode
So it'll come back up!

23:46.825 --> 23:50.295
Next Episode
The phantom continent will rise again
as they play the wedding march.

23:50.295 --> 23:52.597
Next Episode
And then the bride and groom will
walk out all dressed in white!

23:52.597 --> 23:54.199
Next Episode
Oh, how dreamy! Hey, let's do that!

23:54.199 --> 23:55.534
Next Episode
Do it yourself!

23:55.534 --> 23:55.901
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.901 --> 23:56.468
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.468 --> 23:57.102
The 16th Night
Bell of Evil
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:57.102 --> 23:58.370
The 16th Night
Bell of Evil
"Bell of Evil"

23:58.370 --> 24:00.138
The 16th Night
Bell of Evil
Another strange mystery!

24:00.138 --> 24:01.070
The 16th Night
Bell of Evil
